{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-25T06:39:21.755Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1777","claim:pm-gh1778","claim:pm-gh1780","lineage:pm-gh1778","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1777+pm-gh1778+pm-gh1780","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1777","claim:pm-gh1778","claim:pm-gh1780","lineage:pm-gh1778","lineage:pm-ugqx","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-25T06:39:21.755Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-25T06:39:21.754Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation: pm package list, pm packages list and pm extension list are now aliases of pm package inventory (Commander alias moved off catalog; alias contracts owner pm-gh1777, extension list targets package inventory because the deprecated extension vocabulary has no live-contract inventory row); catalog keeps the bundled catalog. Inventory rows gain update (last observed newer version for the installed version) and the result gains updates_available. One --fields contract (parseListingFields/projectListingRows, published with the inventory reader so the CLI stays on the SDK export closure) on list, explore, manage and catalog; unknown keys are refused as 'must be one of a|b|c', which recovery turns into allowed_values. Default explore/manage rows drop the embedded contributions map (--fields ...,contributions restores it). pm extensions list now suggests package list with an executable --help retry: a singular/plural slip of a noun that is neither a command nor an alias resolves through the alias contracts, then follows typed operands. Measured on this repo: package list 574 B (was 11,976 B, the catalog); explore 5,991 to 3,837 B; manage 6,018 to 3,864 B. Static fast path covers list. Gates: grammar, flag contracts, contracts fixture, completion, SDK surface (two additive inventory type changes acknowledged), static chain green."}]}],"before_hash":"8a8a54bf1b1d0f248b08c4cfe50448158deb61c245fe8b75b6748c46f42b7cbb","after_hash":"a3e9db7bc1557f624274113f8e3d5ba2ed4c903be62d0fdf12a4842ad3a89f6f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e82dd62358040e24a70139facd228aab86c72cb8423119e906c2bd836f91e630"}
